<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= (=.) \\* t. (a : t) (b : t) : bool =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = \\ () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        Lua = \\ () =>\n            ? (~> ?: t ?| i64 => !+ | u64 => !+ | _ => !-)\n            ?> $'spiral_w64.eq(!a, !b)' : bool\n            |: $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        Fsharp = \\ () => $'!a = !b ' : bool\n        Python = \\ () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        Rust = \\ () => $'!a == !b ' : bool\n        TypeScript = \\ () => $'!a === !b ' : bool\n        Zig = \\ () =>\n            ? (~> ?: t ?| string => !+ | _ => !-)\n            ?> $'std.mem.eql(u8, !a, !b)' : bool\n            |: $'(!a == !b)' : bool\n        Lean = \\ () => $'(!a == !b)' : bool\n        Kotlin = \\ () => $'(!a == !b)' : bool\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := (=.) \* t. (a : t) (b : t) : bool =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = \ () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          Lua = \ () =>
              ? (~> ?: t ?| i64 => !+ | u64 => !+ | _ => !-)
              ?> $'spiral_w64.eq(!a, !b)' : bool
              |: $'!a == !b ' : bool
          Fsharp = \ () => $'!a = !b ' : bool
          Python = \ () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          Rust = \ () => $'!a == !b ' : bool
          TypeScript = \ () => $'!a === !b ' : bool
          Zig = \ () =>
              ? (~> ?: t ?| string => !+ | _ => !-)
              ?> $'std.mem.eql(u8, !a, !b)' : bool
              |: $'(!a == !b)' : bool
          Lean = \ () => $'(!a == !b)' : bool
          Kotlin = \ () => $'(!a == !b)' : bool
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

