<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":? append t : t -> t -> t\n\n:= (++) a b =\n    b |> append a\n\n:== pair_switch a b =\n    {\n        Gleam : $'##(`a, `b  )'\n        Lua : $'(`a, `b)'\n        Fsharp : $'(`a * `b)'\n        Python : $'(`a, `b)'\n        Rust : $'(`a, `b)'\n        TypeScript : $'[`a, `b]'\n        Zig : $'@@Tuple(&.{ `a, `b })'\n    }\n:! pair a b = $'backend_switch `(pair_switch a b)'\n\n:= pair x y =\n    x, y","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  :? append t : t -> t -> t

  := (++) a b =
      b |> append a

  :== pair_switch a b =
      {
          Gleam : $'##(`a, `b  )'
          Lua : $'(`a, `b)'
          Fsharp : $'(`a * `b)'
          Python : $'(`a, `b)'
          Rust : $'(`a, `b)'
          TypeScript : $'[`a, `b]'
          Zig : $'@@Tuple(&.{ `a, `b })'
      }
  :! pair a b = $'backend_switch `(pair_switch a b)'

  := pair x y =
      x, y
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

