#### try_unit_rescues_a_failure_on_gleam (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> gleam -d exception=\">= 2.0.0 and < 3.0.0\"\n\n:= hits = mut 0i32\ntry_unit (\\ () => failwith \"boom\") \\ _ => hits <- *hits + 1i32\n*hits |> _assert_eq 1i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> gleam -d exception=">= 2.0.0 and < 3.0.0"

  := hits = mut 0i32
  try_unit (\ () => failwith "boom") \ _ => hits <- *hits + 1i32
  *hits |> _assert_eq 1i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

