#### try_unit_rescues_a_failure_on_lua (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> lua\n\n:= hits = mut 0i32\ntry_unit (\\ () => failwith \"boom\") \\ _ => hits <- *hits + 1i32\n*hits |> _assert_eq 1i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> lua

  := hits = mut 0i32
  try_unit (\ () => failwith "boom") \ _ => hits <- *hits + 1i32
  *hits |> _assert_eq 1i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### try_finally_cleans_up_on_lua (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test --symbol\n///> lua\n\n:= cleaned = mut 0i32\ntry_finally (\\ () => ()) \\ () => cleaned <- *cleaned + 1i32\n*cleaned |> _assert_eq 1i32","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test --symbol
  ///> lua

  := cleaned = mut 0i32
  try_finally (\ () => ()) \ () => cleaned <- *cleaned + 1i32
  *cleaned |> _assert_eq 1i32
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
